1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:01,100
Banks lent

2
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:01,860
this oil dealer

3
00:00:01,860 --> 00:00:03,440
over $150 million

4
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:04,910
against tanks of water.

5
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:06,920
Tino De Angelis

6
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:07,660
ran a refinery

7
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:08,520
in Bayonne,

8
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:08,910
New Jersey.

9
00:00:09,690 --> 00:00:10,580
An American Express

10
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:11,500
company vouched

11
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:12,480
for his tanks,

12
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:13,350
so lenders lined up.

13
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:15,080
But most tanks

14
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:15,660
held water,

15
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:16,460
with a thin layer

16
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:17,260
of oil floating

17
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:17,690
on top.

18
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:19,420
Inspectors checked

19
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:20,330
