22
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:23,530
Behind them,

23
00:00:23,530 --> 00:00:24,040
pipes moved

24
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:24,800
the same oil

25
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:25,610
into the next tank.

26
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:28,640
In November 1963,

27
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:29,340
it all collapsed.

28
00:00:30,410 --> 00:00:31,420
Barely 1/16

29
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:32,400
of the promised oil

30
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:32,800
existed.
